window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><strong>Delilah </strong>hates Christmas. She’s a strong independent witch who has finally left her hometown of Oak Haven and is off forging her own path. But an emergency drags her back just in time for the holidays.</p> <p><strong>Jasper </strong>is a human who also hates Christmas. He’s attempting to avoid festivities when he stumbles into the magical world of Oak Haven – a place which definitely isn't supposed to exist – and sees things which <em>should </em>be impossible.</p> <p>When chaos erupts in the town, Delilah and Jasper must join forces to restore order. They should be the perfect team. Their only problem? Their growing attraction to each other might be distracting them from their work…</p> <p> <strong>Perfect for fans of:</strong> </p> <p>Forced proximity </p> <p>Witchy aesthetic </p> <p>Cozy small town </p> <p>Sisterhood and found family </p> <p></p>"; 
